# Sales Performance Dashboard

This folder contains the Power BI (.pbix) project file for the Sales Performance & Profitability Dashboard.

The dashboard provides an interactive executive overview of business performance, covering revenue, cost of goods sold (COGS), total profit, profit margins, customer metrics, brand performance, regional sales, and monthly profitability trends.

**Tool:** Microsoft Power BI

**File:** Sales_Performance_Dashboard.pbix

**Purpose:** Business Intelligence, Sales Analysis, and Profitability Reporting.

